//You now own some property and you want to calculate the total area of the property.
Create a program that:
Reads the width and height
Prints the area
Example: width = 5, height = 2
Output: total_area = 10
//你现在拥有一些房产，你想计算该房产的总面积。
创建一个程序，用于：
读取宽度和高度
打印面积
示例：width = 5, height = 2
输出：total_area = 10
import java.util.Scanner;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);

        try {
            // Get width input from user
            System.out.print("Enter the width of the property: ");
            double width = scanner.nextDouble();

            // Get height input from user
            System.out.print("Enter the height of the property: ");
            double height = scanner.nextDouble();

            // Validate inputs (must be positive)
            if (width <= 0 || height <= 0) {
                System.out.println("Error: Width and height must be positive numbers!");
                return;
            }

            // Calculate total area (width × height)
            double totalArea = width * height;

            // Display result in the required format
            System.out.printf("total_area = %.0f%n", totalArea);

        } catch (Exception e) {
            // Handle non-numeric input errors
            System.out.println("Error: Please enter valid numbers for width and height!");
        } finally {
            scanner.close();
        }
    }
}
